[
  {"comment":"SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT. Convert to Sheet Metal with rips (mitcad#1949, GitHub mitcad/Mitcad#377): t=2, r=3, K=0.3, the corner gap the thickness, Bisect. Each tray is converted from its outer bottom face and the four bottom edges as bends; the four corner edges between the walls become rips."},
